= Project Narrative

#set par(justify: true)

Protein and peptide databases are important resources for biomedical research and drug discovery. However, many peptide sequences contain unknown amino acids and incomplete functional annotations, which reduce the reliability of artificial intelligence models. This project will create a curated peptide database with improved sequence quality and expanded annotations to support reliable peptide function prediction. The proposed work will improve computational peptide analysis and may support future development of antimicrobial and therapeutic peptides.